
PROFILE:

Quiet, watchful, and
easy to miss. Nobody
in Villa ever knew
what Ramon was
thinking. Not even
his own family.
For years that made
him something to
laugh at. Then he
took up scouting and
salvage, and the
strangeness they'd
mocked started
bringing Villa what
it needed to live.
If anyone can last
out there alone, it
is him.